From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:20:29 +0100
Subject: Adjust the intl tests to ICU 76

ICU 72 to 76 changed the formatted dates, the collation keys and some
display names. Backport of the upstream split of these tests by ICU
version (the *icu72-1, icu74.1 and icu76_1 variants from PHP 8.1 and 8.3)
and of the relaxed locale display expectations.
